. La aplicaci\u00f3n cuenta con una interfaz clara y accesible, f\u00e1cil de navegar con las gafas puestas. Crea, edita y elimina alarmas con gestos sencillos y disfruta de notificaciones visuales y sonoras claras que te garantizan que nunca te pierdas un momento importante, ya sea que est\u00e9s jugando, trabajando o relaj\u00e1ndote en RV.", "short_description": "Esta alarma tiene: Temporizador, Cron\u00f3metro y alarma de conversi\u00f3n."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "portrait.png", "id": "2905496342955542", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507823984_2905496346288875_7146297178865334511_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=D4-xVlbsJe0Q7kNvwHkBBxw&_nc_oc=Adr5oGVu1eHX-efZHc6TmHM5yQx4colMHoX6MV6AMzQdHc2nDGSvQQiGREDhnEL0beY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2yszxVUlHrFV49zkI5sNQjQXBImu8W0ONDPgbWvB-bdQ&oe=69E0DDBE"}, {"file_name": "icono-512.png", "id": "2243906042732063", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618482_2243906046065396_1094352884120925797_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0yxWp79DsEMQ7kNvwGw_atW&_nc_oc=AdqIG6fjMyMjgfAkODTulxbCSBAOaSAWZo4sZolN1n1aEY7yCVjR1F5ghG3XvN_IOuk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3n-GGOUVtkaJ2mdI1S6GxJE5VaKFgLSYyXp1e1s0yHjg&oe=69E0F45E"}, {"file_name": "square.png", "id": "1745867016009353", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831056_1745867019342686_1501165532938032609_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Lm-l2WpdV0UQ7kNvwHlgKSq&_nc_oc=AdohkLneeNMvdfx_wB12bJj-OaHs7xdCQpJ0hg6ocGDYmY6n1eJ27Y9X7-W80qx-9-Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1wJZoxf4YHo-Gdnz-2bRA2HqXKg3ELMeyUzniiTsv9SQ&oe=69E0E9DB"}, {"file_name": "hero cover.png", "id": "1368705761087761", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://sco